{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The core concept is set: a sharp, developer-focused label called STATUS/WEAR—minimal tees built around the tiny status codes people live by (“200 OK,” “404 OFFLINE,” and “418 TEAPOT”). I’ve confirmed the exact globally fulfilled Prodigi garment and variants, and I’m now building the buying flow around Stripe test checkout and sandbox fulfillment."}}
